{
    "name": "E2E RoomPriceGenie - ari updates",
    "description": "Sends availability, rates, restrictions and a reservation of the connected sandbox property, and one event through Make API Call.",
    "notes": {
        "7a010f2f-8535-4ccc-b23a-cea9e14b0e62": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 720,
            "width": 880,
            "height": 320,
            "content": "## Never run\n\nThis flow was written from RoomPriceGenie's documentation and has only passed `appmixer e2e validate`. No RoomPriceGenie test account existed when it was written. See README.md in this folder for what a run needs.\n\n## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\nThe connected property is a **sandbox property** whose inventory is the one of the flow \"E2E RoomPriceGenie - inventory\" (room type `E2E-DBL`, rate plan `E2E-BAR`), and RoomPriceGenie has confirmed the mapping. Before that, RoomPriceGenie does not accept availability, rates and restrictions.\n\nThe flow writes availability, a price, a minimum stay and one reservation for the next days into that property. There is nothing to clean up: the API has no delete."
        }
    },
